AutoPET V Topology-Safe Adaptive Submission

This repository includes Apache-2.0 components from publicly released
AutoPET lesion-segmentation and interactive-segmentation implementations.
Their original license files and copyright notices are retained alongside
the corresponding source trees.

Submission-specific modifications include:
- FDG probability calibration and burden-aware connected-component filtering;
- PSMA logistic false-positive component pruning;
- stateless component-local EDT correction;
- corrected crop-to-model click-coordinate mapping;
- conservative no-background-deletion and topology safety gates;
- Grand Challenge runtime composition and reproducible weight verification.

The EDT checkpoint is redistributed as a GitHub Release asset under the terms
of its upstream Apache-2.0 project. The AutoPET-III weights are fetched from
their original Zenodo record and are not mirrored in this repository.
